{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfRDj5t3cLYZfG9pVMi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short version: yeah, I'll keep it. A keren hishtalmut is savings my employer and I both pay into every month out of my salary. The money gets invested, and as long as it stays in there I pay no tax on what it earns. I can take it out tax-free **6 years after the first payment**, or after 3 years if it's for a course or training. I can take it earlier too, but then I pay tax. Mostly the employer puts in the money (up to \"7.5%\" from them, my part \"2.5%\"), and I'd be dumb to give that up. I'm fairly sure. What settled it was \"6 שנים\" showing up again and again, plus the example with the green bar beating the yellow one.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Top of the page.** Heading \"קרן השתלמות\" and the line under it: savings from the salary, tax-free after the period. Good, that's exactly my question.\n- **\"מה זה\".** \"6 שנים אחרי התשלום הראשון\", or \"3 שנים\" for \"השתלמות\", and \"אפשר למשוך גם קודם: הכסף לא נעול\".\n- **\"מה מייחד\".** There was a box with S&P 500, Meitav against \"ילין לפידות\", and a salary field already set to 12,000. Mine is different, but I didn't touch it.\n- **The bars, after 10 years.** Keren hishtalmut 17,370 ₪, securities account 16,955 ₪, \"ההפרש… 415.84 ₪\". Honestly, I took 17,370 to be what I'd have at the end. Then I saw \"הרווח נטו… פחות מה שהפקדת\", so maybe it's just the profit? Not sure. And a difference of 415 ₪ over ten years seems tiny. So is it worth it or not?\n- **The line under the bars.** One line said the difference is \"בין ‎−342.02 ₪ לבין 2,106 ₪\". I saw a minus and that freaked me out a bit. So it can come out worse? I didn't get why.\n- **\"כסף נכנס ויוצא\".** Big text: \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\", the money arrives \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\", and I can move to another company without tax. That was enough for me.\n- **\"מיסוי\".** Just the card headings: \"אין מס על הרווחים\" and \"פטור במשיכה אחרי תקופת ההמתנה\".\n- **The orange warning box.** I caught the start, \"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\". That was enough, I didn't read the rest.\n- **\"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\".** Only the first line: the money is held separately from the management company. Good.\n- **The glossary (\"מונחים\").** Saw it was a table of terms and stopped there. Didn't open screen 9.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"שינוי הסכומים\" and \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\" folds, the fees table under \"כמה זה עולה\", the companies, the little \"חוקים וכללים\" tags everywhere, and the 31% / 47% numbers in the orange box.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"משכורת קבועת\", \"ותק\", \"סכום מוטב\", \"דמי נאמן\", and what \"123 מקור / מחושב / הזנתה\" at the top means. Also \"מההפקדה החודשית שלכם רק 300 ₪ נחשבים\", 300 out of 500? I didn't get what happens to the rest.\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- The 17,370 isn't clear: total or profit?\n- The minus sign in the range.\n- The whole comparison is for someone on 12,000, not me.\n- The page never tells me what to actually do: how I find out which company runs mine and which track I'm in.\n\nI didn't feel like leaving the page, but past the taxes it got long and boring."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3713,"cache_read_input_tokens":15690,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3713},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4ccdc7a-e6dd-4daf-9fe0-6fdad4846aba","uuid":"bfcadc14-bc59-44de-a80e-f3a8c3be2d26","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:20:03.879Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfRDTT86uqmfSuUyJt5"}
